        "accession_number": "0001315098-26-000024",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Although currently enjoined by federal court, if the injunction is lifted or if similar legislation such as the proposed federal Kids Online Safety Act is enacted, we may be required to alter our Platform design, age estimation methods, and content recommendation algorithms.",
        "start_character": 54937,
        "end_character": 55212
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001315098-26-000024",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001315098-26-000024-ff45d4915ef1517c",
        "accession_number": "0001315098-26-000024",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Beginning in January 2026, we implemented mandatory age-check systems in all chat-enabled regions designed to check a user’s age prior to accessing chat on our Platform.",
        "start_character": 13577,
        "end_character": 13746
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001315098-26-000024",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001315098-26-000024-ff45d4915ef1517c",
        "accession_number": "0001315098-26-000024",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Data centers in the Roblox Cloud are linked through a high-performance dedicated backbone network bypassing the public internet for traffic within and between our data centers and we operate under an open peering policy where we have direct interconnection with internet providers globally.",
        "start_character": 27337,
        "end_character": 27627
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001315098-26-000024",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001315098-26-000024-ff45d4915ef1517c",
        "accession_number": "0001315098-26-000024",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In total (including our subsidiary entities), we are the owner of over 530 trademark filings, including over 50 trademark applications in the U.S.",
        "start_character": 65623,
        "end_character": 65769
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001315098-26-000024",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001315098-26-000024-ff45d4915ef1517c",
        "accession_number": "0001315098-26-000024",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Our Community Standards govern what is acceptable content and behavior, including communications, on the Platform, and we have multi-layered moderation systems, including both automated and human review, that are designed to assess content uploaded to Roblox and communications on Platform for potential violations of our policies.",
        "start_character": 11327,
        "end_character": 11658
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001315098-26-000024",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001315098-26-000024-ff45d4915ef1517c",
        "accession_number": "0001315098-26-000024",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "To enjoy the benefits of the safe harbor and be immune from monetary damages for infringing content uploaded by our users, we have to register a designated agent with the U.S.",
        "start_character": 68311,
        "end_character": 68486
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001315098-26-000024",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001315098-26-000024-ff45d4915ef1517c",
        "accession_number": "0001315098-26-000024",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We continue to invest in creating tools for our creators designed to promote key experience genres and deepen engagement on our Platform.",
